  "_twist": {
    "sourceSystem": "lo-and-behold",
    "intensity": 5,
    "description": "Brutalist transformation: Anton 400 (all-caps geometric condensed) at 160px/100px — raw poster scale that crushes the viewport. Space Mono 400 at 14px for all body/UI text — monospace terminal aesthetic. Line-height 1.0 for all headings — zero breathing room. Zero letter-spacing. Maximum visual tension: 160px display vs 14px body is an 11× size gap. Two fonts, two worlds: massive compressed all-caps vs. fixed-width terminal type."
